{
  "_comment": "Distill the 28-block k2-lion full-FT teacher (step 25600) into a 2-block student: keep_blocks [0, 27], everything else inherited verbatim (krea2/tools/make_student.py builds the weights). Plain output MSE on image tokens, teacher single pass no CFG, uncond_ratio 0.1 -> CFG-free student. DDP via ramtorch MultiGPUWrapper (ZeRO-1): fp32 student masters + bf16 autocast, frozen bf16 teacher/Qwen/VAE per GPU. Smoke at 256px; for the 1024 run bump resolution, parquet_dataloader.base_resolution, batch_size (4/GPU is a safer start), preview_steps and minres/maxres stay as-is. Student weights must exist first: uv run python krea2/tools/make_student.py runs/k2-lion/1024-resume-21400-rustfs/ckpts/full_step_25600.safetensors checkpoints/krea2/student2_step25600.safetensors --keep 0 27",
